--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Modifications (by kodai-n11qbb)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following modifications have been made to the original work:

  - Configured ONNX Runtime to force single-threaded WASM mode
    (ort.env.wasm.numThreads = 1) for compatibility in environments
    where SharedArrayBuffer is unavailable (e.g. self-signed HTTPS).
  - Integrated as a build dependency of the ws2infer-js project,
    with automated build via Cargo build.rs.
  - Adjusted import paths and worker configuration to work within
    the ws2infer-js static asset pipeline.

